Subsequent changes in fair value of performing investments under Available for Sale (AFS) and Fair Value Through Profit and Loss ('FVTPL') (including Held For Trading ('HFT')) categories have been recognised through AFS reserve and Profit and Loss Account respectively. Accordingly, the amounts for periods prior to April 01, 2024 are not comparable.  &lt;BR&gt; 
